## ObjectType: buying business process

Source label: buying business process. Source IRI: `https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/BuyingBusinessProcess`. Source definition: business process wherein a financial instrument is used by an agent (buyer) to acquire ownership of a product or commercial service from another agent (seller) for the buyer itself or for another agent (customer)

